# Research (frozen)

`CLRSLean/Research/` collects exploratory Lean developments that are not part
of the CLRS book formalization boundary.

## ThreeDIC

`Research/ThreeDIC/` contains routine experiments on 3D-IC hybrid-bonding
routing-load models (window/strip/affine load counting).  This was ordinary
supporting work, frozen in September 2026 when the project refocused on
organizing the CLRS book content.  It is not imported by the library root,
not listed in the site navigation, and is not actively maintained.  It does
not appear in `docs/clrs-proof-progress.csv` or any advertised status count.
